## ERASURE - RUN TO THE SUN (1994)
#  133 BPM, C Major, 144 bars (~4:20). Vince Clarke & Andy Bell (produced by Martyn Ware).
#  From the critically acclaimed 1994 album 'I Say I Say I Say'.
#
#  Authentic Vince Clarke Synth-Pop Production Features:
#    1. Rock-solid 16th-note Roland System 100M / Minimoog bouncing bassline (C, F, E, Dm, G, Bb, Am, Cm)
#    2. Vince's signature Roland Jupiter-8 / Oberheim 16th arpeggios through dotted-8th ping-pong stereo delay
#    3. Andy Bell's soaring, soulful vocal melodies with true sustained phrasing and analog portamento
#    4. The iconic Middle-8 easter egg quoting the opening measures of 'A Little Respect'
#    5. Rich sustained analog chord beds using DWGS strings (w15), Solina (w79), and ESQ-1 choir formants (w61)
#    6. Zero-hanging note architecture with explicit l0 note-off releases and smooth legato
#    7. Full voice labeling via [name] vt for effortless debugging
#    8. Headroom-managed master mix hierarchy (punchy kicks & snares, zero limiter distortion)
#
#  Load:   [run_to_the_sun.sk] /ls
#  Play:   play
#  Stop:   stop
#
#  VOICE MAP:
#    v0  punchy analog kick (w82) + v5 sine sub body (w0 f440)
#    v1  backbeat snare body (w83) + v4 crisp handclap (w86)
#    v2  closed hi-hat 16ths (w84)  v3 open hi-hat sizzle (w85)
#    v6  Vince Clarke 16th bass saw (w15, centre) + v7 sub sine octave partner (w0 N-12)
#    v8  Jupiter-8 16th arpeggio centre (w15 saw) + v9 stereo partner (w20 clavi, p.35)
#    v10 high bell sparkle arpeggio (w29 dwg-bell, p-.55) + v11 partner (w51 esq1-bell, p.55)
#    v13 Andy Bell soaring vocal lead (w15 saw, centre) + v14 detuned partner (w16, right)
#    v15 call-and-response counter lead (w22 dwg-brass)
#    v16 accent cowbell (w96)
#    v17 crash cymbal downbeats (w94)
#    v18 chord bed root (w15) + v19 chord third (w79 solina, p-.55) + v20 chord fifth (w61 choir, p.55)
#    v21 Middle-8 acoustic pluck synth ('A Little Respect' tribute hook, w25 aguitar)
#    v22 ESQ-1 vocal choir pad (w61 voice1) + v23 partner (w62 voice2)
#    v24 pad lfo  v26,v27 pad prototype  v28-v35 warm poly pad pool
#
#  DELAY BUSES:
#    Bus 1: Vince arpeggios & bells dotted-eighth echo (DS 1 133 .75, DP 1 1)
#    Bus 2: Bass slapback sixteenth (DS 2 133 .25)
#    Bus 3: Snare & Clap ambient chamber reverb (DS 3 133 .5)
#    Bus 4: Vocal lead & choir hall wash (DS 4 133 .75, DP 4 1)
# ======================================================================

[ERASURE - RUN TO THE SUN (1994)] puts
[use 'play' to start, 'stop' to stop] puts
M 133 16

## DELAY BUSES
# Bus 1: Signature Vince Clarke dotted-eighth ping-pong echo on arpeggios & bells
DS 1 133 .75
DL 1 - - 8 3 4 11
DD 1 7 3
DP 1 1

# Bus 2: Bass slapback 16th (thickens without mud)
DS 2 133 .25
DL 2 - - 4 0 0 7
DD 2 6 4

# Bus 3: Snare & Clap chamber wash
DS 3 133 .5
DL 3 - - 6 0 0 9
DD 3 5 3

# Bus 4: Vocal lead & choir wide ping-pong hall wash
DS 4 133 .75
DL 4 - - 11 3 8 10
DD 4 8 2
DP 4 1

## VOICES
# Drums: Tight Vince Clarke 808/analog electro percussion
