v8 >9
v9  w20 a-8 N0,9 p.35 t.003,.18,0,.05 j1 k2000 q1.2 r1 ds.40 [jupiter arp clavi partner] vt
v8 G9 H9

# High Crystalline Bell Arpeggio (DWGS Bell + ESQ-1 Bell)
