v10 >11
v11 w51 a-10 N0,7 p.55 t.001,.30,0,.10 j1 k4500 q1.0 r1 ds.40 [esq1 bell right] vt
v10 G11 H11

# Andy Bell Soaring Vocal Lead: SUSTAINED, smooth portamento, hall reverb
v13 w15 a-5 p0 t.012,.20,.75,.22 j1,2 k3400 q1.4 c4,.15 g.04 r4 ds.35 [andy bell soaring lead] vt
v13 >14
v14 w16 a-8 N0,10 p.40 t.012,.20,.75,.22 j1 k3200 q1.2 r4 ds.35 [vocal partner] vt
v13 G14 H14

# Call-and-Response Counter Synth Brass
v15 w22 a-7 p-.35 t.005,.30,0,.10 j1 k3200 q2.0 r1 ds.25 [dwg counter brass] vt

# Warm Sustained Analog Chord Bed: 100% sustained across each bar!
v18 w15 a-9 p0 t.03,.25,.80,.25 j1 k1800 q.8 r4 ds.25 [chord bed root] vt
v18 >19
v18 >20
v19 w79 a-11 N0,6 p-.55 t.03,.25,.80,.25 j1 k2200 q.8 r4 ds.25 [chord bed string third] vt
v20 w61 a-12 N0,-6 p.55 t.03,.25,.80,.25 j1 k2400 q.8 r4 ds.25 [chord bed choir fifth] vt

# Middle-8 'A Little Respect' Tribute Hook Synth
v21 w25 a-5 p0 t.002,.25,0,.06 j1 k3600 q1.4 r1 ds.30 [little respect tribute hook] vt

# Ensoniq ESQ-1 Vocal Choir Pad (w61 voice1 & w62 voice2)
